    "title": "Join us at 5pm for this week's Hoon",
    "text": "Photo by Brendon van Zyl on Unsplash Kia ora\nCome and join us for our weekly ‘Hoon’ webinar with paying subscribers to The Kākā for an hour at 5 pm today.\nJump on this link on YouTube Livestream for our chat with myself, co-host Peter Bale and regular guests Robert Patman and Cathrine Dyer . We’ll also be joined by trade expert Stephanie Honey , who has worked as a trade diplomat for MFAT .\nWe’ll…\nKeep reading with a 7-day free trial Subscribe to The Kākā by Bernard Hickey to keep reading this post and get 7 days of free access to the full post archives.\nStart trial Already a paid subscriber? Sign in\nPrevious\nA guest post by Robert Patman Robert Patman is a University of Otago’s Inaugural Sesquicentennial Distinguished Chair and a specialist in international relations. Subscribe to Robert\nA guest post by Steph Honey Former New Zealand trade negotiator and current trade policy consultant with a focus on global trade issues, regional economic integration and digital trade.",
